<section xml:id="section-finite-fields">
  <title>Finite Fields</title>
  <p>
    I've left out one important definition for fields. I'll state it
    now, as it serves as good introduction to finite fields.
  </p>
  <definition>
    <statement>
      <p>
        Let <m>K</m> be a field. Let <m>p</m> be the smallest positive
        integer such that <m>p1 = 0</m> in <m>K</m>, if it exists.
        (That is, 1 added to itself <m>p</m> times is 0). This number
        is called the <term>characteristic</term> of the field. If no
        such number exists, the characteristic of the field is
        infinity. 
      </p>
    </statement>
  </definition>
</section>
